  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fa5db35ac5d81d49b0eff06f993ad07, type: 3}
  m_Name: Take the Apple
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - paragraph: You take a bite. The apple's juice drips from your lips, sweet sensations
      dancing on your tongue. The taste is exquisite, unlike any fruit you've ever
      had. You close your eyes, savoring the moment as the flavors unfold, rich and
      succulent. A rush of energy flows through your body, invigorating and refreshing
      every fiber of your being. You feel lighter, almost euphoric, as if all the
      weariness of your journey has melted away.
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups: []
      sectionalAudioClips: []
  - paragraph: As the satisfaction reaches its peak, you open your eyes to thank
      the wizard. But suddenly, the atmosphere shifts. The wizard's aura darkens,
      his soft smile transforming into a mischievous grin.
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups: []
      sectionalAudioClips: []
  - paragraph: '"HAHAHAHA...how delightfully naive." His voice dripping with disdain.
      "You''ve been betrayed young lad." Confusion and fear grip you. "Nothing in
      estrainia is as it seems. If you stay yourself you will not survive. The Apple
      you ate is cursed! It will consume your soul leaving a useless shell... However
      I will grand you a choice. Give me all your money and you get the curing potion.
      If not take a taste of you last breath. "'
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups: []
      sectionalAudioClips: []
  promptResponses:
  - response: Take the Potion
    responseAction:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
